{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.40.010","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"29c8b0d237a067a230da2af55c4f7cb65f46cc7eeafa62a76c1cdea891a87086","heading":"Purpose and intent.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"The purpose of this chapter is to:\n(a) Prevent the introduction of pollutants into the municipal stormwater system which will interfere with the operation of the system;\n(b) Prevent the introduction of pollutants into the municipal stormwater system which will pass through the system, inadequately treated, into receiving waters;\n(c) Prevent erosion and flooding of public and private properties caused by uncontrolled stormwater runoff;\n(d) Enable the Utilities Department to ensure compliance with any stormwater applicable permits, and meet water quality requirements and other stormwater discharge criteria which are required by State and Federal law; and\n(e) Provide for the establishment of penalties for violation of this chapter. (Ord. 20262 § 10, 10-6-20.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"48491d46-cffe-5e99-81b6-2b73a14145f8"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"ba21515edb34007e3aaf042813e3d4133ec7236eb7deee191cec9f18de7b5633","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"The purpose of this chapter is to:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fec7d9e4-ae4e-59c9-91d7-66733db50fb7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"c858edfca76b0fe5f8f55e431960a5e131fbb95c6aed13e1ba8efba45a5803d8","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"(a) Prevent the introduction of pollutants into the municipal stormwater system which will interfere with the operation of the system;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8de67bdc-0d42-5d44-8a38-462a29a3493a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"8fe066f1b6f4b2f216ec0905fbd37419f8c8298a0efc8770dcc3834eb5a54fc7","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"(b) Prevent the introduction of pollutants into the municipal stormwater system which will pass through the system, inadequately treated, into receiving waters;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"cbedf1a6-d051-5f74-93f6-49d658f1dc8e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"01b88ab7d9342f26823ab8a302ebc46db6c6a07c21b796906e6b771571d64cb0","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"(c) Prevent erosion and flooding of public and private properties caused by uncontrolled stormwater runoff;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"48b7021e-4ef0-5175-959d-a4aa076f5191"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"0493d94b028f1c4f96aa3b17b5bfd3129194018768023786e19ae6a0ce3eb9c0","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"(d) Enable the Utilities Department to ensure compliance with any stormwater applicable permits, and meet water quality requirements and other stormwater discharge criteria which are required by State and Federal law; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a258dd52-b76d-521b-acdc-6275e31529d0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.40.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","content_hash":"36c0559768add7b61d4e4de7a78eac54a10128a86e3621d691b73d86a098cb1c","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.40.010","text":"(e) Provide for the establishment of penalties for violation of this chapter. (Ord. 20262 § 10, 10-6-20.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"df7d4520-b3e8-5266-a81b-1c1a079b416c"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.40.010:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}